    description: "CBSE re-result anxiety — how to help your child deal with board exam result stress. Practical tips for parents to support children during result season.",
    date: "13 अगस्त 2026, दोपहर 3 बजकर 40 मिनट",
    modifiedDate: "August 13, 2026",
    author: "Priya Verma",
    authorName: "Priya Verma",
