    description: 'AMU Class 9 entrance swaps EVS for Science and Social Science at Class 8 NCERT level. Verified pattern, competition data and an 8-week bridge plan.',
    keywords: 'AMU Class 9 entrance preparation',
    date: '19 October 2026, 6:15 PM',
