    description: 'Hindi-medium student? The AMU entrance English section needs a 40% qualifying score in Section I. Practical comprehension method, 8-week bridge plan, and mistakes to avoid.',
    keywords: 'AMU entrance English comprehension, AMU Class 6 English preparation, Hindi medium students AMU entrance',
    date: '21 October 2026, 11:15 AM',
    modifiedDate: 'October 21, 2026',
    author: 'Priya Verma',
    authorName: 'Priya Verma',
    authorSlug: 'priya-verma',
    authorRole: 'Student Counselor',
    authorBio: 'Priya specializes in child psychology and mental well-being. She helps students manage exam stress and build a healthy mindset during tough preparation phases.',
    readTime: '8 mins',
